-=== Stack layout
+=== Returns from interrupt handlers
 
-To ease debugging, a stack layout is recommended for the saved context.
+When executing an {ipopxret} instruction the context save during the trap is restored and a return is executed.
 
-NOTE: This stack layout is not mandated to allow e.g. shadow register sets
